  "notes": "ladder JSON absent: every metric is null, not zero | Two deliberate divergences from the GB10 fixture, both because the campaign's common block is the SSOT for a cell: the fixture pins bf16 KV and max_batch_size 2 (a GB10 memory constraint plus the atlas#110 workaround), the campaign pins fp8 KV and max-batch-size 32. Record the divergence in the artifact notes if a Hopper OOM forces the fixture values back. Spec matches the vLLM recipe's mtp K3 with the default --num-drafts 3. FP8 KV calibration: FP8 checkpoints that ship no *.k_scale tensors get scale 1.0, which clips BF16 into E4M3 (spark-runtime weights.rs fp8_kv_scale_count); the GB10 rehearsal of 2026-09-05 (Nano FP8 through the nvfp4 bundle, 'missing FP8 KV scale tensors, default 1.0') produced degenerate output. 256 calibration tokens is the value kernels/gb10/qwen3.6-35b-a3b/MODEL.toml uses for its FP8 checkpoint. Applies only with --kv-cache-dtype fp8. | model.revision is null: no actual model launch evidence was captured"
